-- A statement takes one MIGRATE clause.
DEFINE FIELD f ON t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS a USING 1 MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS b USING 2;
ALTER FIELD f ON t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS a USING 1 FALLBACK 0 MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS b USING 2;
ALTER TABLE t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS a REMOVE UNDECLARED FIELDS MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS b REMOVE UNDECLARED FIELDS;
